  "description": "We listen to our community — and we build bikes around what riders really want: a fast road bike that stays comfortable on rough roads, stable on long rides, and lively when you push the pace.\n\nThe 8bar KRONPRINZ v3 combines featherlight weight with an aerodynamic silhouette and the latest standards, including clean internal cable routing and modern SRAM UDH dropouts.\n\nNot an easy task — but we nailed it with the 8bar KRONPRINZ v3: the ultimate all-rounder road bike.\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT & FLEXIBILITY\n\nHigh-modulus carbon construction delivers a lightweight 780g frame and 300g fork with engineered material flex, providing efficient power transfer and enhanced comfort on long rides.\n\nCLEAN DESIGN & AERODYNAMIC\n\nFully internal cable routing creates a sleek, clean aesthetic while protecting cables and supporting both modern electronic and mechanical groupsets. The design features an aero-shaped head tube, integrated seatpost clamp, and streamlined seatpost for maximum efficiency and aerodynamic performance.\n\nCOMFORT & WIDER TIRE CLEARANCE\n\nLowered seat stays enhance both aesthetics and comfort, while the optimized geometry allows tire clearance up to 35mm—improving grip, ride quality, and versatility across a wide range of road surfaces.\n\nUDH READY\n\nSRAM UDH-ready, making it fully prepared for modern drivetrain systems. This ensures better compatibility, easier service, and long-term reliability.\n\nCONFIDENT ALL-WEATHER BRAKING\n\nFlat-mount disc brakes deliver powerful, consistent stopping performance in all conditions—from fast descents to wet city streets. The clean flat-mount standard improves integration, reduces weight, and enhances overall frame aesthetics while giving you precise control when it matters most.",
